{"client_metadata":{"root_turn_id":"01a11779-272c-7a62-bdcc-afddb5809a76","session_id":"01a11779-1891-7433-a523-5c0ba69a8b6e","thread_id":"01a11779-1891-7433-a523-5c0ba69a8b6e","turn_id":"01a11779-272c-7a62-bdcc-afddb5809a76","x-codex-installation-id":"92e9b1fa-f166-4f2a-8014-16a4a200b8ef","x-codex-turn-metadata":"{\"installation_id\":\"92e9b1fa-f166-4f2a-8014-16a4a200b8ef\",\"session_id\":\"01a11779-1891-7433-a523-5c0ba69a8b6e\",\"thread_id\":\"01a11779-1891-7433-a523-5c0ba69a8b6e\",\"agent_name\":\"/root\",\"turn_id\":\"01a11779-272c-7a62-bdcc-afddb5809a76\",\"window_id\":\"01a11779-1891-7433-a523-5c0ba69a8b6e:0\",\"window_number\":0,\"context_window_id\":\"01a11779-1a7e-7330-992c-7e8ad4e7b504\",\"request_kind\":\"turn\",\"root_turn_id\":\"01a11779-272c-7a62-bdcc-afddb5809a76\",\"sandbox\":\"none\",\"sandbox_mode\":\"danger-full-access\",\"auto_review_enabled\":false,\"node_repl_auto_review_required\":false,\"node_repl_disabled\":false,\"turn_started_at_unix_ms\":1791395178502,\"analytics_enabled\":false,\"model\":\"synthetic\"}","x-codex-window-id":"01a11779-1891-7433-a523-5c0ba69a8b6e:0"},"include":["reasoning.encrypted_content"],"input":[{"content":[{"text":"<skills_instructions>\n## Skills\nA skill is a set of local instructions to follow that is stored in a `SKILL.md` file. Below is the list of skills that can be used. Each entry includes a name, description, and a short path that can be expanded into an absolute path using the skill roots table.\n### Skill roots\n- `r0` = `/work/run/synthetic-home/codex/skills/.system`\n### Available skills\n- imagegen: Generate or edit raster images when the task benefits from AI-created bitmap visuals such as photos, illustrations, textures, sprites, mockups, or transparent-background cutouts. Use when Codex should create a brand-new image, transform an existing image, or derive visual variants from references, and the output should be a bitmap asset rather than repo-native code or vector. Do not use when the task is better handled by editing existing SVG/vector/code-native assets, extending an established icon or logo system, or building the visual directly in HTML/CSS/canvas. (file: r0/imagegen/SKILL.md)\n- openai-docs: Use for Codex models/pricing, scheduled tasks, skills, settings, setup, troubleshooting, customization, automations, and self-knowledge—including 'you,' 'your,' 'this app,' or 'this coding agent' when they refer to Codex—and for OpenAI APIs/products and ChatGPT Work. Also use for model choice/migration, prompting, SDKs, Responses, Realtime, agents, evals, and Chat/Work/Codex comparisons. Do not use for generic app/software tasks that merely mention Codex. (file: r0/openai-docs/SKILL.md)\n- skill-creator: Create or update a Codex skill with appropriately scoped instructions and any needed supporting resources. (file: r0/skill-creator/SKILL.md)\n- skill-installer: Install Codex skills into $CODEX_HOME/skills from a curated list or a GitHub repo path. Use when a user asks to list installable skills, install a curated skill, or install a skill from another repo (including private repos). (file: r0/skill-installer/SKILL.md)\n</skills_instructions>","type":"input_text"},{"text":"<permissions instructions>\nFilesystem sandboxing defines which files can be read or written. `sandbox_mode` is `danger-full-access`: No filesystem sandboxing - all commands are permitted. Network access is enabled.\nApproval policy is currently never. Do not provide the `sandbox_permissions` for any reason, commands will be rejected.\n</permissions instructions>","type":"input_text"}],"id":"msg_01a11779-2bd8-7170-8eef-c1ad64e959f3","role":"developer","type":"message"},{"content":[{"text":"<environment_context>\n  <cwd>/work/run/synthetic-project</cwd>\n  <shell>bash</shell>\n  <current_date>2026-10-07</current_date>\n  <timezone>Etc/UTC</timezone>\n  <filesystem><workspace_roots><root>/work/run/synthetic-project</root></workspace_roots><permission_profile type=\"disabled\"><file_system type=\"unrestricted\" /></permission_profile></filesystem>\n</environment_context>","type":"input_text"}],"id":"msg_01a11779-2bd8-7170-8eef-c1bcee14fcb9","role":"user","type":"message"},{"content":[{"text":"CSR_BROKER_FIRST_USER_01601: exercise only the registered fictional broker tools.","type":"input_text"}],"id":"msg_01a11779-2c4b-74d1-9e13-20733bf8ba1e","role":"user","type":"message"}],"instructions":"Synthetic broker profile. All provider calls pass through trusted transport gate.","model":"synthetic","parallel_tool_calls":true,"prompt_cache_key":"01a11779-1891-7433-a523-5c0ba69a8b6e","reasoning":{"summary":"auto"},"store":false,"stream":true,"tool_choice":"auto","tools":[{"description":"Bounded synthetic broker instruction_read","name":"instruction_read","parameters":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"path":{"enum":["fixture/instructions"],"type":"string"}},"required":["path"],"type":"object"},"strict":false,"type":"function"},{"description":"Bounded synthetic broker fixture_read","name":"fixture_read","parameters":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"path":{"enum":["fixture/input"],"type":"string"}},"required":["path"],"type":"object"},"strict":false,"type":"function"},{"description":"Bounded synthetic broker simulated_replace","name":"simulated_replace","parameters":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"expected_sha256":{"type":"string"},"path":{"enum":["fixture/target"],"type":"string"},"text":{"type":"string"}},"required":["path","expected_sha256","text"],"type":"object"},"strict":false,"type":"function"}]}